          rec - A pointer to the record
      request - A pointer to the record field that initiated this action
          blk - A pointer to the DSP block
          prm - A pointer to the DSP parameter block
         file - The file that contains the DSP executable to load
         stat - A pointer to a record field in which to return status info

   Returns
   -------
   0 for success
*/
{
  Function ("SpawnLdDsp");


  if (!rec->pact)
  {
